    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique and exhilarating game is here, where you become a sponge character and clean up a messy room until it shines!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the satisfaction of a cute sponge character scrubbing away dirt and grime with adorable movements and visuals. But it\u2019s not just about cleaning\u2014enjoy the thrill of dodging chasing enemies and sometimes even fighting back as you tidy up the room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you play, you\u2019ll definitely get hooked!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to Clean</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re a sponge! Just run over dirty spots, and watch the grime disappear. Got a mess in hard-to-reach places? No problem\u2014spray water to clean up those tricky spots. Make the house sparkle and enjoy the satisfaction!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to Clear a Level</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill the cleaning meter to 100% to clear the stage!<br>Once you\u2019re familiar with the basics, try optimizing your cleaning strategy to aim for a high score. It\u2019s a fun challenge!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Refresh Yourself When Dirty</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you clean, you\u2019ll get dirty too. When that happens, look for refresh points around the house to clean yourself up. Staying fresh is key to keeping up the cleaning momentum!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight Off Mischievous Kids!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A playful boy will run around the house trying to disrupt your cleaning efforts. Don\u2019t worry\u2014spray him with water to chase him away! Stay focused and keep the house spotless while handling this mischievous intruder.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique and exhilarating game is here, where you become a sponge character and clean up a messy room until it shines!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the satisfaction of a cute sponge character scrubbing away dirt and grime with adorable movements and visuals. But it\u2019s not just about cleaning\u2014enjoy the thrill of dodging chasing enemies and sometimes even fighting back as you tidy up the room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you play, you\u2019ll definitely get hooked!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to Clean</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re a sponge! Just run over dirty spots, and watch the grime disappear. Got a mess in hard-to-reach places? No problem\u2014spray water to clean up those tricky spots. Make the house sparkle and enjoy the satisfaction!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to Clear a Level</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill the cleaning meter to 100% to clear the stage!<br>Once you\u2019re familiar with the basics, try optimizing your cleaning strategy to aim for a high score. It\u2019s a fun challenge!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Refresh Yourself When Dirty</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you clean, you\u2019ll get dirty too. When that happens, look for refresh points around the house to clean yourself up. Staying fresh is key to keeping up the cleaning momentum!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight Off Mischievous Kids!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A playful boy will run around the house trying to disrupt your cleaning efforts. Don\u2019t worry\u2014spray him with water to chase him away! Stay focused and keep the house spotless while handling this mischievous intruder.</p>",
